# Pretty URLs for "We ❤ [Town]" community pages
# /we-love/<slug> -> the real community directory page, slug passed through as ?c=
/we-love/:town    /ilove-community-directory.html?c=:town    200

# Custom domain for Jennifer's Rhome page — silent rewrite, no visible redirect
# Scoped to the exact root path only (no wildcard!) so other real pages on this
# domain (like the admin login) aren't swallowed by this rewrite too.
# Forced (200!) because weloverhome.com/ would otherwise be shadowed by the site's real index.html
https://weloverhome.com/    /ilove-rhome-example.html    200!
https://www.weloverhome.com/    /ilove-rhome-example.html    200!

# Custom domain for the WeLoveMyHometown umbrella pitch/landing page.
# Same root-path-only, forced-200 pattern as the other custom domains.
https://welovemyhometown.com/    /welovemyhometown.html    200!
https://www.welovemyhometown.com/    /welovemyhometown.html    200!

# Custom domain for Carly Harrison's Robson page — routes to the generic
# multi-tenant directory template (not a bespoke build like Rhome's), scoped
# to her real slug robson-ranch-2. Same root-path-only, forced-200 pattern.
https://weloverobson.com/    /ilove-community-directory.html?c=robson-ranch-2    200!
https://www.weloverobson.com/    /ilove-community-directory.html?c=robson-ranch-2    200!
